# The functions of Windows that the runtime calls, a library a line: its
# name, then the functions. compiler/windows-x86_64/imports.sh makes of
# this list the import tables of an executable and, for the runtime, the
# place of each function's address in them.
kernel32.dll ExitProcess GetStdHandle WriteFile ReadFile CreateFileA CloseHandle GetLastError GetCommandLineA GetEnvironmentStringsA VirtualAlloc VirtualFree
